        ],
        "evidence": [
          "state.turso_opt() is called in at least 8 observe endpoints as the gate for whether Turso-backed queries are possible. The name 'turso_opt' is an implementation detail (returns an Option of a Turso store) rather than communicating intent (e.g. 'is persistent storage available'). Callers always pattern-match it with if let Some(turso) = state.turso_opt()."
        ],
