      "detector": "review",
      "file": ".",
      "tier": 3,
      "confidence": "high",
      "summary": "Authorization mapping API is infallible despite parsing dynamic input",
      "detail": {
        "holistic": true,
        "dimension": "api_surface_coherence",
        "related_files": [
          "crates/temper-agent-runtime/src/tools/mod.rs",
          "crates/temper-authz/src/error.rs"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "`to_cedar(&self, name: &str, input: &Value) -> CedarMapping` is infallible (`tools/mod.rs:58`).",
          "The function consumes untyped JSON and tool name strings, which can be malformed/unknown but has no error path.",
          "Authz layer already defines validation-style failures (`InvalidPrincipal`, `InvalidResource`) (`authz/error.rs:14-24`), implying mapping/validation failures are first-class in this subsystem."
