          "`list_evolution_records` and `list_evolution_insights` only call `state.persistent_store()` (Turso) and otherwise return empty arrays (`crates/temper-server/src/observe/evolution/records_list.rs:23-80,88-127`).",
          "CLI/server bootstrap still provisions Postgres evolution storage (`PostgresRecordStore::migrate`) indicating expected non-Turso support (`crates/temper-cli/src/serve/storage.rs:49-54`)."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Define one explicit compatibility policy and enforce it end-to-end: either (1) make evolution read APIs backend-agnostic by introducing a shared `EvolutionReadStore` trait with Postgres+Turso implementations, or (2) explicitly declare Turso-only for evolution and fail fast on non-Turso startup. Update README and route behavior to match that policy (no silent empty fallback).",
