          "crates/temper-server/src/observe/specs.rs",
          "crates/temper-server/src/observe/entities.rs"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "`extract_tenant` in `odata/common.rs` falls back to first registered tenant, then `TenantId::default()` when header is absent.",
          "`observe/entities.rs` uses this extracted tenant to build actor keys and fetch history.",
