    "review::.::holistic::high_level_elegance::state_dispatch_api_is_parameter_aggregate::b4102ef0": {
      "id": "review::.::holistic::high_level_elegance::state_dispatch_api_is_parameter_aggregate::b4102ef0",
      "detector": "review",
      "file": ".",
      "tier": 3,
      "confidence": "medium",
      "summary": "Dispatch ownership is obscured by passing a wide cross-domain request bag.",
      "detail": {
        "holistic": true,
        "dimension": "high_level_elegance",
        "related_files": [
          "crates/temper-server/src/state/dispatch_blocking.rs",
          "crates/temper-server/src/insight_generator.rs"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "`BlockingWasmDispatch` aggregates tenant identity, entity identity, action, effects, state snapshot, agent context, and action params in one struct (dispatch_blocking.rs lines 13-22), then just forwards all fields to internal dispatch (lines 38-47).",
          "The method returns a boxed future from an `impl ServerState` extension (lines 31-36), making the state root object a broad orchestration surface rather than exposing narrower collaborators for integration dispatch."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Extract a dedicated integration-dispatch service with a typed command object organized by cohesive sub-objects (identity, invocation, context); keep `ServerState` as composition root and delegate via a stable trait boundary.",
        "reasoning": ""
