        "related_files": [
          "crates/temper-server/src/events.rs",
          "crates/temper-mcp/src/error.rs"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "`serde_json::to_string(&change).unwrap_or_default()` replaces serialization failure with empty string (`events.rs:50`).",
          "Elsewhere (e.g., MCP) serialization issues are typed and surfaced (`McpError::Serialization`, `crates/temper-mcp/src/error.rs:52-55`), creating inconsistent failure behavior."
