          "crates/temper-server/src/registry.rs"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "`resolve_entity_type`, `tenant_csdl_xml`, and `tenant_entity_sets` silently mix SpecRegistry data with legacy maps (`odata/common.rs:62-97`).",
