        "suggestion": "Staged reorg plan: 1) Introduce `crates/temper-server/src/observe/service/` (e.g., `agent_audit.rs`, `entity_history.rs`) and move Turso/event-store orchestration there. 2) Keep `observe/agents.rs` and `observe/entities.rs` as thin axum adapters calling service functions. 3) Move shared observability DTOs that are transport-agnostic into `temper-observe` only where cross-crate reuse is proven, then update imports. 4) Validate with `cargo check -p temper-server -p temper-observe` and `cargo test -p temper-server`.",
