      "file": ".",
      "tier": 3,
      "confidence": "high",
      "summary": "Five observe/verification.rs endpoints have no authorization checks: run_verification, run_simulation, handle_design_time_stream, handle_workflows, and get_paths. These handlers do not accept HeaderMap and never call require_observe_auth, while all sibling observe endpoints consistently enforce auth.",
