        "suggestion": "Add HeaderMap parameter and require_observe_auth call to all five endpoints. For run_verification use action 'run_verification', for run_simulation/get_paths use 'read_verification', for handle_design_time_stream/handle_workflows use 'read_events'. Also add observe_tenant_scope to handle_workflows to filter by tenant.",
