      "confidence": "high",
      "summary": "The deprecated RecordStore in temper-evolution/src/store.rs is still actively used in temper-server's ServerState, despite being marked #[deprecated] with a note referencing ADR-0025 Phase 4. The migration to IOA entity dispatch via the temper-system tenant is incomplete.",
