          "Clippy warnings in the blind packet: 'warning: use of deprecated struct temper_evolution::store::RecordStore: Use IO' appears 3 times for state/mod.rs"
        ],
        "suggestion": "Complete ADR-0025 Phase 4 by migrating sentinel and insight dispatch to use IOA entity dispatch against the temper-system tenant, then remove the deprecated RecordStore and the #[allow(deprecated)] annotations.",
