          "Line 270: if let Some(ref store) = self.event_store { Self::replay_events(...) }",
          "Line 276: if self.event_store.is_some() && state.events.is_empty() { ... }",
          "Line 285: if let Some(ref store) = self.event_store { Self::persist_event(...) } -- this inner check is always true given the outer guard"
        ],
        "suggestion": "The inner if-let at line 285 is redundant since it is nested inside a block where self.event_store.is_some() was already checked at line 276. Restructure to avoid the double check.",
