          "Line 262: const HTTP_FETCH_WASM: &[u8] = include_bytes!(...) -- embeds ~200KB WASM binary",
          "Line 265: self.wasm_engine.compile_and_cache(HTTP_FETCH_WASM) -- synchronous compilation in constructor"
        ],
        "suggestion": "Make WASM registration lazy or opt-in. Tests that don't exercise WASM integration pay the compilation cost unnecessarily. Consider a with_builtin_wasm() builder method.",
