          "Lines 73-74: `pub kind: String` documented as: 'spec_loaded, verify_started, verify_level, verify_done'"
        ],
        "suggestion": "Consider using #[serde(rename_all = \"snake_case\")] enums for the kind fields. This gives compile-time exhaustiveness checking at construction sites while maintaining the same JSON wire format.",
