          "Line 233: `timestamp: chrono::Utc::now()` in another InsightRecord",
          "The RecordHeader::new() function used in other tests likely also uses wall clock"
        ],
        "suggestion": "Use sim_now() in tests for consistency with the DST convention, even in deprecated modules, to prevent copy-paste propagation of non-deterministic patterns.",
