        "evidence": [
          "operations.rs: persist_evolution_record writes to Turso",
          "operations.rs: create_system_entity writes to IOA entities",
          "state/mod.rs: RecordStore still available for in-memory reads",
          "Three persistence paths for the same data"
        ],
        "suggestion": "Prioritize completing the ADR-0025 migration. The IOA entity path should be the single source of truth, with Turso as its persistence backend. Remove the in-memory RecordStore and the direct Turso writes.",
