      "file": ".",
      "tier": 3,
      "confidence": "medium",
      "summary": "temper-evolution RecordStore trait is deprecated but has no replacement trait defined",
      "detail": {
        "holistic": true,
        "dimension": "convention_outlier",
        "related_files": [
          "crates/temper-evolution/src/store.rs"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "The RecordStore trait is marked #[deprecated(note = 'Use IOA entity dispatch to temper-system tenant (ADR-0025)')]",
          "PostgresRecordStore still implements this trait and is actively used in CLI storage setup (connect_postgres_store)",
          "The codebase convention is to use IOA entity dispatch, but the trait and its implementation remain as the active path for Postgres"
